Author: benjamin <benschac@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Nov 25 12:36:55 2026 -0500

    Count the demo's diagrams and tasks in the viewer scenes
    
    The scene fixtures answered one DrawDiagram mount, and a reader scene
    expected "87 of 116 tasks done". Both assumed this repo's plan: a plan
    that adds a Mermaid diagram to any spec section, or adds tasks, failed
    some 30 scenes. The fixtures now answer and end one DrawDiagram per
    mermaid fence in the demo's documents, and the reader scene counts the
    done tasks from the demo trace's statuses.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

